{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんにちは！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "乃木坂46 6期生の\n瀬戸口心月（せとぐち みつき）です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まずは"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "昨日のやってしまった出来事。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「ここで靴脱ぐことなんて、まずないよね！」"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "と思っている場所に限って、\nなぜか靴を脱ぐときがあったりしますよね。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "しかもそういう時に限って、\nよりによって変な靴下を履いているっていう。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「くさないわっ」って文字が書いてあったり、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "キャラクターがどーんと主張してきたり、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "脱いだ時にバッチリ目が合って、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あ、やらかしたー。ってなるやつです！！(^^;;"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "誰にも何も言われてないのに、勝手に一人でじわじわ恥ずかしくなったりするんですよ笑"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これ、共感してくれる人いるかな。。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "きっといるはず、\n仲間がいたらぜひ教えてください(^_^)！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ということで、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "久しぶりの突然なお話しでしたが🧦"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日は、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "乃木坂スター誕生！SIXについて✨🎤"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "1月26日(月)24:59～\n日本テレビ「乃木坂スター誕生！SIX」の放送で、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "CHiCOさんがゲストにくてくださり、大越ひなのちゃんと森平ちゃんと CHiCO with HoneyWorksさんの「世界は恋に落ちている」"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "愛宕心響ちゃん、川端晃菜ちゃん、長嶋凛桜ちゃん、増田三莉音ちゃんが有華さんの「バースデーソング」"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "鈴木佑捺ちゃんとわたしが井上苑子さんの「赤いマフラー」"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "を披露させていただきました✨"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私はずっと、ゆうちゃんと一緒に歌いたいねって話していたので、私の好きな「赤いマフラー」をこうして一緒に歌うことができて嬉しかったです🧣"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202601/mobOX2NoM.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "赤いマフラーをお揃いでつけちゃったり^_^"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あとあと"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "一年に一度の特別な日〜〜✨"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "萌華の誕生日を皆んなでお祝いできました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "改めて気づいたけど、\n萌華はまだ18歳で、もう成人なんだよね。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "萌華と出会ったとき、私はちょうど18歳。\n「そのときの私と同じなんだよね」って話をして、時間の巡り合わせに、なんだか不思議な気持ちになりました！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "きっとこの一年も、気づいたらあっという間なんだろうな。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "だからこそ今は、いっぱい頼ってほしいし甘えてほしいなーーー！！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつも頼ってばっかりだから、私にできることは少ないかもしれないけど、、、(･_･;"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202601/mobwSPHSc.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これからも一緒に行きたいねって話したところ、（もう100箇所以上ありそうだけど）一つ一つ巡って、一緒に幸せな一年にしようね！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "普段は照れくさくてあんまり言えないけど、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "萌華のこと、だーいすきだよ♡"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202601/mob5TlVoR.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私だけのこの目線、たーくさんあるんだ😆\n今日は一枚だけ！皆さんに共有✌🏻"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202601/mobYQDALy.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お気に入り！この年下感ある感じとてもかわゆす。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "萌華、改めてお誕生日おめでとう！！\nこれからもよろしくね💕👹🌾"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最後まで読んでくださり、\nありがとうございました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日も１日お疲れさまです🌙"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "心月（みつき）"}], "source": "official"}